{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24608","headline":"春池闲泛 · 白居易","name":"春池闲泛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿塘新水平，红槛小舟轻。\n解缆随风去，开襟信意行。\n浅怜清演漾，深爱绿澄泓。\n白扑柳飞絮，红浮桃落英。\n古文科斗出，新叶剪刀生。\n树集莺朋友，云行雁弟兄。\n飞沈皆适性，酣咏自怡情。\n花助银杯气，松添玉轸声。\n鱼跳何事乐，鸥起复谁惊。\n莫唱沧浪曲，无尘可濯缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}